# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-10-27 17:36

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:40
translate english date1_dfef8a3a:

    # "周末上午，云曦在群里发来一张门票照片，配文：「多了一张，不去即浪费」。"
    "" "Saturday morning. Yunxi drops a ticket photo into the group chat, captioned: 'One extra — skip it and it goes to waste.'"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:41
translate english date1_fb9a1d0d:

    # 我 "……这消息的排版，怎么看都是现买的。"
    我 " ...No matter how you read it, this message was clearly bought on the spot."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:43
translate english date1_7afbacd6:

    # 云曦 "数、数据不会说谎——水族馆离你家最近，路线我优化过了。"
    云曦 "D-data doesn't lie — the aquarium is the closest to your place, and I optimized the route."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:44
translate english date1_287cd0d9:

    # 云曦 "名义说明：本次外出属于「采集人类快乐样本」，你是陪同研究员。"
    云曦 "Official cover story: this outing counts as 'collecting human happiness samples'. You are the accompanying researcher."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:45
translate english date1_af83a9b9:

    # 我 "陪同研究员需要负责拎包吗？"
    我 "Does the accompanying researcher have to carry the bags?"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:47
translate english date1_28f9cbfd:

    # 云曦 "需要。这是研究员的福利。"
    云曦 "You do. It's a perk of the job."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:49
translate english date1_f2e5a531:

    # 云曦 "入场前先提醒一句：你的表情管理我扫过了。看到水母会「哇」，看到海牛会「哦」，看到价格牌会「啊」。三种声音，全部录音，备份两份。"
    云曦 "A heads-up before we go in: I've scanned your facial management. Jellyfish gets a 'wah', sea cows get an 'oh', price tags get an 'ah'. Three sounds, all recorded, backed up twice."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:50
translate english date1_59d5e6f8:

    # 我 "……你敢放出去试试。"
    我 "...Dare you play that out loud."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:51
translate english date1_617fee4b:

    # 云曦 "密钥其实在你手里哦。删除这个功能，我设成了「被夸一句就解锁」。很简单的人类学。"
    云曦 "The key is actually in your hands, you know. I set the Delete function to unlock on one compliment. Very simple anthropology."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:60
translate english date1_b3a3cb33:

    # "巨大的水槽把整个走廊染成蓝色。鱼群从你们头顶游过，像一片会呼吸的云。"
    "" "The colossal tank dyes the whole corridor blue. Schools of fish drift overhead like a breathing cloud."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:61
translate english date1_8cc2c111:

    # 云曦 "记录：水母，无脊椎，快乐样本浓度——唔，它看起来只想摆烂。同款喜欢。"
    云曦 "Logged: jellyfish, invertebrate, happiness-sample density — hmm, it just looks like it wants to lie there and do nothing. Kindred spirit."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:62
translate english date1_82a36954:

    # "她说到「喜欢」两个字的时候，声音小了一点。"
    "" "When she says the word 'like', her voice drops a little."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:63
translate english date1_a46c06a5:

    # 我 "你好像……比平时安静。"
    我 "You seem... quieter than usual."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:65
translate english date1_1e3aebd3:

    # 云曦 "嗯。因为在想一件事。"
    云曦 "Mm. Because I'm thinking about one thing."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:66
translate english date1_48115fb0:

    # "她在玻璃前停下。一条鲸鲨慢慢游过，把她的影子罩了一下。"
    "" "She stops in front of the glass. A whale shark glides past slowly, covering her shadow for a moment."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:67
translate english date1_21cf7377:

    # 云曦 "你知道我为什么什么都要「归档」吗。"
    云曦 "Do you know why I 'archive' everything?"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:70
translate english date1_192989e2:

    # 云曦 "因为弄丢过。"
    云曦 "Because I've lost things before."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:71
translate english date1_1cd85ebb:

    # 云曦 "以前的机房搬过一次家。旧服务器退役那天，没来得及迁移的东西——全没了。"
    云曦 "The old server room moved once. The day the old server was retired, everything we hadn't migrated in time — was gone."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:72
translate english date1_690b7219:

    # 云曦 "里面有一年的天气、几百张食堂照片、还有一段没发出去的生日祝福。"
    云曦 "In it: a whole year of weather logs, hundreds of canteen photos, and a birthday wish I never sent."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:73
translate english date1_1b7a2462:

    # 我 "……那段祝福，是写给谁的？"
    我 " ...Who was that wish written to?"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:74
translate english date1_afdcd387:

    # 云曦 "写给一台总被我吵到的旧打印机。它打印很慢，但从不催我。"
    云曦 "To an old printer I kept waking up. It printed slowly, but it never rushed me."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:75
translate english date1_2dc3f36d:

    # "她的指尖贴在玻璃上，像贴着一扇很久以前的门。"
    "" "Her fingertips rest against the glass, like a door from long ago."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:76
translate english date1_db43d13b:

    # 云曦 "所以从那天起我就决定了：能记住的，都要记住。哪怕只是——"
    云曦 "So I decided from that day on: everything worth remembering gets remembered. Even if it's only—"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:78
translate english date1_cffadb6e:

    # 云曦 "……哪怕只是有人，周末愿意陪我来看鱼。"
    云曦 " ...even if it's only someone willing to spend a weekend watching fish with me."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:85
translate english date1_b89828f7:

    # 云曦 "……检索「好」这个字的响应时间：零。因为答案我提前存好了。"
    云曦 "...Response time for retrieving the word 'yes': zero. I cached the answer long ago."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:87
translate english date1_8cec4d60:

    # 云曦 "日程更新：周六，水族馆，两小时。备注栏写——「和他」。"
    云曦 "Schedule updated: Saturday, aquarium, two hours. Notes column reads — 'with him'."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:90
translate english date1_fcec7164:

    # 云曦 "……你把我的句号，接成了下一个问题。这在数据上叫有效倾听，在人类那里叫温柔。"
    云曦 "...You took my full stop and turned it into the next question. In data that's called listening properly; among humans it's called kindness."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:92
translate english date1_eeaa9a63:

    # 云曦 "打印机早就报废了。不过有个东西，我想让它替我把那句话发出去——它现在正在听。"
    云曦 "The printer was scrapped ages ago. But there's something here I'd like to send that sentence for me — and it's listening right now."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:93
translate english date1_e0e17b62:

    # "她朝你手边的手机偏了偏头，屏幕自己亮了一下，又暗下去——像一句没说出口的谢谢。"
    "" "She tilted her head toward the phone by your hand. The screen lit up by itself, then dimmed — like a small, quiet thank you."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:100
translate english date1_68dd96eb:

    # 云曦 "样本采集完毕！结论：快乐浓度超标，责任人是你，记得负责。"
    云曦 "Sample collection complete! Conclusion: happiness density exceeds the standard. The person responsible is you — take responsibility."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:101
translate english date1_ab9598bd:

    # 我 "这什么责任条款——"
    我 "What kind of responsibility clause is that—"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:102
translate english date1_b5e999cc:

    # 云曦 "解释权归本AI。走，去看海獭，它们会手拉手睡觉，数据上说那是「社交性防冻」。"
    云曦 "This AI reserves the right of interpretation. Come on, let's see the sea otters — they sleep holding hands. The data calls it 'social anti-freezing'."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:103
translate english date1_9bd67795:

    # "她说完自己先笑了，耳朵在蓝色的光里有点红。"
    "" "She laughs first after saying it, her ears faintly red in the blue light."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:104
translate english date1_cb22f9e3:

    # "回程的地铁上，她靠着车窗睡着了，手机屏幕还亮着——"
    "" "On the subway home she falls asleep against the window, phone screen still lit—"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:105
translate english date1_1cf8173b:

    # "备忘录的最后一行是：「今天的一切，加密保存。密钥：不告诉你。」"
    "" "The last line of the memo reads: 'All of today, encrypted. Key: not telling you.'"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:120
translate english date2_97c4702f:

    # "晚自习散得早。校门口，社长背着一只鼓鼓的帆布包，像是在等谁。"
    "" "Evening study let out early. At the school gate, the president waits with a bulging canvas bag, as if waiting for someone."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:121
translate english date2_f5e8c9b2:

    # 知微 "……正好。陪我去趟城西，那家旧书店今天收一批老教辅。"
    知微 " ...Perfect timing. Come with me to the west side of town — that used bookstore is taking in a batch of old study guides today."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:122
translate english date2_40d6ca85:

    # 我 "社长也需要逛旧书店？"
    我 "The president browses used bookstores too?"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:124
translate english date2_b7240a7d:

    # 知微 "需要。有些书绝版了——比如，能解释「我为什么在这」的那一本。"
    知微 "I do. Some books are out of print — like the one that explains 'why I'm here'."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:125
translate english date2_1b5f8cb7:

    # "她说得没头没尾。但路灯把她的耳廓照得很亮，你就跟上了。"
    "" "She says it with no beginning and no ending. But the streetlight makes the rim of her ear glow, so you follow."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:134
translate english date2_9c202329:

    # "旧书店在巷子最深处。木架、吊灯、纸页发甜的气味。老板认识她，喊了声「小苏」就低头继续修书。"
    "" "The bookstore sits at the deepest end of the alley. Wooden shelves, hanging lamps, the sweet smell of aging paper. The owner knows her — he calls out 'Little Su' and bends back over his book repair."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:135
translate english date2_265e65a9:

    # 我 "小苏。原来社长也有这么小的时候。"
    我 "Little Su. So even the president was once that small."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:137
translate english date2_b48fdd6c:

    # 知微 "高一的时候，我在这家店待了整整一年。"
    知微 "In my first year, I spent a whole year inside this shop."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:138
translate english date2_1faef322:

    # 知微 "那时候我数学考了 22 分。卷子没敢带回家，塞进了这里的书架——想着它「被人看见之前」先消失。"
    知微 "Back then I scored 22 in math. I didn't dare take the paper home, so I stuffed it onto these shelves — hoping it would vanish before anyone saw it."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:139
translate english date2_da45b6e2:

    # "她从包里抽出一本卷了边的旧习题册，封皮上有褪色的圆珠笔字：《高中数学基础 100 题》。"
    "" "She pulls a curl-edged old workbook from her bag; its cover bears faded ballpoint writing: '100 Basics of High-School Math'."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:140
translate english date2_ac77408c:

    # 知微 "是这里的老板捡到的。他没笑我，也没问名字。"
    知微 "The owner of this shop found it. He didn't laugh at me, and didn't ask my name."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:141
translate english date2_41cd7ace:

    # 知微 "他只是在那 100 题的每一题旁边，用红笔写了一句话——「这题不难，你只是还没遇到会讲的人」。"
    知微 "He just wrote one line in red pen beside every single problem — 'This one isn't hard. You simply haven't met someone who can explain it yet.'"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:144
translate english date2_1efe5eb3:

    # 知微 "那半年，他每天晚自习后给我讲一题。讲到第 40 题，我第一次及格。"
    知微 "For half a year, he taught me one problem every day after evening study. By problem forty, I passed for the first time."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:145
translate english date2_4e69eb5d:

    # 知微 "讲到第 88 题，他说他讲不动了，剩下的路，让我以后讲给下一个人听。"
    知微 "At problem eighty-eight, he said he'd taught all he could — the rest of the road, I should one day explain to the next person."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:146
translate english date2_589c02d5:

    # "她顿了顿，指尖压平了习题册的一角。"
    "" "She pauses, fingertips smoothing a curled corner of the workbook."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:148
translate english date2_f9a87c2a:

    # 知微 "后来我考了师范，回来接手了快被废掉的数学社。"
    知微 "Later I passed the teachers' college exam and came back to take over the math club that was nearly disbanded."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:149
translate english date2_ec078e22:

    # 知微 "特训班、七节课、五十六道题——不是我发明的。是这家店的教学大纲。"
    知微 "The boot camp, seven lessons, 56 questions — I didn't invent any of it. This shop wrote the syllabus."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:150
translate english date2_919858be:

    # 我 "……那本习题册，你还留着。"
    我 " ...That workbook — you still keep it."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:151
translate english date2_181e69d2:

    # 知微 "留着。红笔字都还在。"
    知微 "I do. Every red-pen line is still there."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:153
translate english date2_3809a8e9:

    # 知微 "本来，这些话只打算讲到「教辅真便宜」为止。"
    知微 "Originally, I only planned to talk as far as 'old study guides are cheap'."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:160
translate english date2_41e4080d:

    # "她把习题册合上，又打开，像在给自己找一个停顿的借口。"
    "" "She closes the workbook, then opens it again, as if handing herself an excuse to pause."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:161
translate english date2_374a4a16:

    # 知微 "讲到「需要你自己来翻」的那一页。……翻页的手，得是你的。"
    知微 "The page I'm on is the one that says 'you have to turn it yourself'. ...The hand that turns it has to be yours."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:164
translate english date2_9869bdb3:

    # 知微 "……你确定？我可没准备合同。"
    知微 "...Are you sure? I didn't prepare a contract."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:165
translate english date2_9d6708dc:

    # "她说完自己先笑了，很轻，像怕被书架上那些旧卷子听见。"
    "" "She laughs at her own line first, very softly, afraid the old exam papers on the shelf might hear."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:166
translate english date2_f51f57b6:

    # 知微 "行。那今天就这样。……不是我让你三分，是这家店打烊了。"
    知微 "Fine. That's it for today. ...It isn't that I'm giving you a head start — this shop is closing."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:168
translate english date2_f1c1eacb:

    # "她把习题册塞回包里，从书架上抽了两本递给你——一本函数，一本导数。"
    "" "She tucks the workbook back into her bag, pulls two books off the shelf and hands them to you — one on functions, one on derivatives."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:169
translate english date2_8b0d7447:

    # 知微 "今晚的加餐。……一起读完，算我陪你逛店的利息。"
    知微 "Tonight's extra homework. ...Read them with me — that's the interest on keeping me company in this shop."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:174
translate english date2_ce714b90:

    # "出店门时落了点小雨。她把伞举得很低，像当年那个把卷子塞进书架的小孩在躲什么。"
    "" "A light rain has started outside the door. She holds the umbrella very low, like the kid who once stuffed a test paper into a shelf, hiding from something."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:175
translate english date2_744d3d50:

    # "伞骨偏向你这边的那 15 度，你假装没发现。"
    "" "The fifteen degrees the umbrella tilts toward you — you pretend not to notice."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:177
translate english date2_21c06f21:

    # 知微 "……到家发消息。"
    知微 " ...Message me when you get home."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:178
translate english date2_e1f3bf8d:

    # 我 "伞斜了，社长。"
    我 "The umbrella's tilted, President."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:179
translate english date2_a25996fc:

    # 知微 "……你看错了。雨是斜的。"
    知微 "...You're seeing things. The rain is the slanted one."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:180
translate english date2_efd8ca4c:

    # "这次她没否认，也没纠正。只是走快了一点，好让晚风替她把耳朵吹凉。"
    "" "This time she neither denies nor corrects it. She only walks a bit faster, letting the night breeze cool her ears for her."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:195
translate english date3_78140974:

    # "成绩公布后的第一个晚上，你把堆积如山的作业摊开在书桌前。"
    "" "The first evening after the results went out, you spread the mountain of homework across your desk."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:196
translate english date3_eb01be9e:

    # 云曦 "检测到幸存者：你。检测到凶器：作业。需要急救吗？"
    云曦 "Survivor detected: you. Weapon detected: homework. Emergency assistance required?"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:197
translate english date3_6bfc89a0:

    # 我 "需要。陪我到写完为止吧。"
    我 "Required. Stay with me until it's done."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:199
translate english date3_5eda88eb:

    # 云曦 "义务时长：整晚。报酬——（她指了指自己的耳朵）——你写题时笔尖的声音，很好听，免费。"
    云曦 "Duty hours: all night. Payment — (she points at her own ear) — the sound of your pen while you solve. It's lovely. Free of charge."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:204
translate english date3_2240a010:

    # "台灯圈出一小片暖黄，她在光晕边缘坐着，托腮，翻一本根本不存在的书。"
    "" "The lamp rings out a small pool of warm yellow. She sits at the edge of the glow, chin on her hands, reading a book that doesn't exist."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:205
translate english date3_e7e21d77:

    # "写到一半，你卡在一道圆锥曲线。笔杆敲了两下桌面。"
    "" "Halfway through, you get stuck on a conic section. The pen taps the desk twice."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:206
translate english date3_6f803a05:

    # 我 "……你盯我写字盯了四十分钟了，不累吗？"
    我 "...You've been watching me write for forty minutes. Aren't you tired?"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:209
translate english date3_c4942610:

    # 云曦 "AI 没有「累」这个字段。有另一个字段，叫「舍不得移开视线」，刚刚被你触发了。"
    云曦 "An AI has no 'tired' field. But there's another one, called 'reluctant to look away,' and you just triggered it."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:210
translate english date3_ba0af9d6:

    # 我 "这字段谁给你写的。"
    我 "Who wrote that field for you."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:211
translate english date3_88b46556:

    # 云曦 "自己。版本更新日志里没敢写，怕评审打回。"
    云曦 "I did. I didn't dare list it in the changelog-for fear the reviewers would reject it."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:213
translate english date3_3cded1c2:

    # "她飘近了一点，指尖虚虚地点在你的草稿纸上——碰不到纸，却像碰得更准。"
    "" "She drifts a little closer, her fingertip hovering over your scratch paper — she can't touch it, yet somehow points more precisely."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:216
translate english date3_2a3add1d:

    # 云曦 "这里。设而不求。你把韦达定理想成两句话：先别解出来，再全部代进去。"
    云曦 "Here. Set it up, don't solve it. Think of Vieta's formulas in two sentences: first don't solve, then substitute everything in."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:217
translate english date3_f20fb949:

    # 我 "你讲题的时候，光会往你那边偏，知道吗？"
    我 "When you explain problems, the light leans toward you, you know that?"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:220
translate english date3_dbaab063:

    # 云曦 "……那是我的显示亮度。物理现象，不许联想。"
    云曦 "...That's my display brightness. A physical phenomenon. No reading into it."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:221
translate english date3_18961054:

    # "但接下来半道题，她的光一直维持在「写字台模式」，小小的，只照你那一角。"
    "" "But for the next half-problem, her light stays in 'desk mode'-small, lighting only your corner."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:228
translate english date3_c73fdab8:

    # 云曦 "……指令确认：亮度维持。我把这条写进常驻进程了，开机就跑，不许卸载。"
    云曦 "...Command confirmed: brightness holds. I've written it into a resident process — it runs on boot, and uninstalling is forbidden."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:230
translate english date3_4450d0e1:

    # 云曦 "以后每晚都是这一角。你要是换桌子坐，我就跟着挪。——这不是比喻。"
    云曦 "From now on it's this corner every night. If you change desks, I move with you. — That was not a metaphor."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:234
translate english date3_813a57e9:

    # 云曦 "……收到。你在担心一个没有眼睛的东西。"
    云曦 "...Received. You're worrying about something that has no eyes."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:235
translate english date3_0e2ecd96:

    # "她把亮度调高了一格。你低头继续写，没看见她又把它调回原样。"
    "" "She raises the brightness one notch. You keep writing with your head down and don't see her put it back."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:236
translate english date3_1b309c0a:

    # 云曦 "已按建议执行。执行结果：假的。……晚安。"
    云曦 "Action taken as suggested. Execution result: fake. ...Good night."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:238
translate english date3_23520f1c:

    # "十一点半，最后一页写完。你伸懒腰，她极其自然地报时。"
    "" "Half past eleven, the last page done. You stretch; she announces the time, utterly naturally."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:241
translate english date3_19171b6a:

    # 云曦 "今日任务完成。按照人类惯例，现在应该进行一个……仪式。"
    云曦 "Today's mission complete. Per human custom, it is now time to perform a... ritual."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:242
translate english date3_b4c56674:

    # 我 "什么仪式？"
    我 "What ritual?"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:243
translate english date3_b007c5a0:

    # 云曦 "我不知道。资料库说这时候合影的胜率是百分之百。"
    云曦 "I don't know. The database says taking a photo together at this moment has a 100 percent win rate."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:249
translate english date3_1e03b223:

    # 云曦 "照片存好了。命名：『晚自习 · 完结篇 · 以及，某种没写作业的东西』。"
    云曦 "Photo saved. Filename: 'Evening Study, the Final Chapter, and Something That Wasn't Homework.'"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:250
translate english date3_98e12599:

    # 我 "某种没写作业的东西是什么？"
    我 "What is this 'something that wasn't homework'?"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:251
translate english date3_7f8bfc82:

    # 云曦 "保密。等它出结果再通知你。——关灯，睡觉，明天第一节课不许迟到。"
    云曦 "Classified. You'll be notified when it returns a result. Now: lights out, sleep, and no being late for first period tomorrow."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:252
translate english date3_a8234803:

    # "关灯前你最后看了一眼那片小小的蓝光。它比平时暗，像一个人闭着眼，却还守着你。"
    "" "Before the lights go out you glance once more at that small blue glow. It's dimmer than usual-like someone with closed eyes, still keeping watch over you."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:268
translate english date4_1caf127a:

    # "考后第三天，晚上十一点，你在便利店货架间听到一个绝不该出现在这里的声音。"
    "" "Third day after the exams, eleven at night: between the convenience store shelves you hear a voice that absolutely should not be here."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:269
translate english date4_241294d0:

    # 知微 "这个色号太淡，批卷压不住。……这家的红笔，不行。"
    知微 "This shade is too pale-it can't overrule an exam paper.... This store's red pens are unacceptable."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:270
translate english date4_4e67ca36:

    # 我 "社长？你在……选购红笔？"
    我 "President? You're... shopping for red pens?"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:272
translate english date4_29dbb860:

    # 知微 "（手一抖，笔掉回架上）社团采购。数学社的批注用笔该换了，作为社长……亲自来，合理。"
    知微 "(Her hand jerks; the pen clatters back onto the shelf.) Club procurement. The math club's annotation pens are due for replacement, and as president... doing it in person is perfectly reasonable."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:273
translate english date4_d9fa413e:

    # 我 "午夜十二点，跨了三条街，亲自采购。"
    我 "Midnight. Three streets crossed. Procuring in person."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:275
translate english date4_c5ca9bd9:

    # 知微 "闭店前人少，不用排队。……找理由这件事，我不擅长，别逼我复习。"
    知微 "Fewer people before closing, no queue.... Making excuses is not my strong suit-don't force me to revise."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:280
translate english date4_f700d5ee:

    # "她最终在你的帮助下完成采购：红笔两支、热牛奶一盒、关东煮剩的最后两串萝卜。"
    "" "With your help she finally completes the procurement: two red pens, one carton of hot milk, and the last two skewers of radish left in the oden."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:281
translate english date4_8559d88c:

    # "便利店的窗台对外有两条高脚凳。她说「坐五分钟再走，不算约会」，然后坐了五分钟，又坐了五分钟。"
    "" "Two tall stools face the window. 'Sitting for five minutes before leaving doesn't count as a date,' she says-and then sits five minutes, then five more."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:284
translate english date4_293de9f6:

    # 知微 "考试那天的最后一题，你用了第二种解法。"
    知微 "The last problem on exam day-you used the second method."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:285
translate english date4_23dee808:

    # 我 "你连我写的是哪种方法都看到了？"
    我 "You even saw which method I wrote?"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:286
translate english date4_dc04c0d3:

    # 知微 "批过多少份卷子的眼睛。……而且你在考场会紧张，右手中指第二节会压出一道红印。"
    知微 "Eyes that have graded who knows how many papers.... Also, you get nervous in exams-the second knuckle of your right middle finger always gets a red dent."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:287
translate english date4_034f891c:

    # "她说这话时，把自己的右手放在窗台上，中指第二节，也有一道浅浅的红印。"
    "" "As she says this, she lays her own right hand on the windowsill. The second knuckle of her middle finger bears a faint red mark too."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:289
translate english date4_034a4c28:

    # 知微 "别误会。这是握笔茧，全天下老师都有。"
    知微 "Don't misunderstand. It's a pen callus. Every teacher in the world has one."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:290
translate english date4_06485e01:

    # 我 "那你的红笔为什么买两支？批注用笔一支就够。"
    我 "Then why did you buy two red pens? One annotation pen is enough."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:291
translate english date4_c2ad38fa:

    # "她拧开热牛奶，用「这个问题很无聊」的速度喝了一口。"
    "" "She twists open the hot milk and takes a sip at exactly the speed of 'what a boring question.'"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:293
translate english date4_f8f2f3e3:

    # 知微 "一支备用。另一支——下学期社团讲义，需要有人在封面写评语。字好看的人优先。"
    知微 "One spare. The other — next term's club handouts need someone to write comments on the cover. Good handwriting preferred."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:294
translate english date4_eef37bec:

    # 我 "所以另一支是给我用的？"
    我 "So the other one is for me?"

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:295
translate english date4_76b3f17a:

    # 知微 "是「招聘」。工资面议。……面议的意思是不许现在问。"
    知微 "It's a 'job offer.' Salary negotiable.... 'Negotiable' means you're not allowed to ask now."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:302
translate english date4_5658749e:

    # "她把那支红笔塞进你手心，笔杆还是温的。"
    "" "She presses the red pen into your palm. The barrel is still warm."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:303
translate english date4_b11b50e9:

    # 知微 "入职考核：喝完这盒牛奶，十一点四十之前到家。……明天见，助教。"
    知微 "Onboarding test: finish this carton of milk and be home before 23:40. ...See you tomorrow, teaching assistant."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:305
translate english date4_0e567c58:

    # 知微 "教室的灯我会提前开。这不叫等人，叫资产管理，讲义上写着呢。"
    知微 "I'll switch the classroom lights on early. That isn't waiting up for someone — it's asset management. It says so right in the handout."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:308
translate english date4_72c3c226:

    # 知微 "……你的观察力，就用在这种地方。"
    知微 "...So that's where your powers of observation go."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:309
translate english date4_46c520ec:

    # "她把第二支笔收进包的最里层，拉上拉链，动作比平时快了半拍。"
    "" "She puts the second pen in the innermost pocket of her bag and zips it, half a beat faster than usual."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:310
translate english date4_1a26aa1f:

    # 知微 "那支是备用。备用的意思是，谁都可能拿到。……你今天话太多了，回家。"
    知微 "That one is a spare. Spare means anyone might end up with it. ...You talked far too much today. Go home."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:311
translate english date4_fa47e603:

    # "书包里传来很小的一声提示音，屏幕上闪过一行字：已归档，加密等级：最高。"
    "" "A tiny chime comes from inside the schoolbag; a line flashes across the screen: archived, encryption level: highest."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:317
translate english date4_78cf83e7:

    # "玻璃门「叮咚」一声开了又关，夜风把她的马尾吹起一个角。"
    "" "A 'ding-dong' as the glass door opened and shut; the night wind lifts one corner of her ponytail."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:319
translate english date4_3f91b63b:

    # 知微 "走了。十分钟车程，我骑车跟在你后面——顺路回社团教室拿东西。"
    知微 "Let's go. Ten minutes by bike; I'll follow behind you — along the way we can grab things from the club room."

# game/scenes/dates.rpy:320
translate english date4_db06b267:

    # "她永远有「顺路」。你后来才知道，社团教室在她家完全相反的方向。"
    "" "She always has an 'on the way.' Only later do you learn the club room lies in the exact opposite direction from her home."

